Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.34,0:00:06.77,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去寻找吧 收集起梦的碎片{\fad(250,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.38,0:00:17.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使胸中苦闷 去感受真切的现在吧{\fad(0,400)}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.59,0:00:22.62,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比外表更单纯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.33,0:00:25.99,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是却无法传达
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.90,0:00:33.60,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要说的话 总是藏在口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.21,0:00:39.94,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,充满孩子气的话语 如今已无法开口
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.65,0:00:48.11,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽说时间会冲淡一切 我们却无法相互理解
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.22,0:00:54.22,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,24小时 一直相信着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:58.12,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看着你
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.16,0:01:02.69,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即使只是俗常的话语
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.17,0:01:08.97,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间总是 微笑着匆匆流逝
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.24,0:01:20.71,OP,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比起回忆 还是去追求理想的今天{\fad(0,1025)}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.79,0:01:40.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这题考前猜到了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.86,0:01:43.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这题也是轻轻松松解决
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.56,0:01:46.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯嗯 最近很用功
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:48.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.10,0:01:50.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,了不起 日暮同学
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:52.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,满分呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.54,0:01:53.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.11,0:01:56.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样高中入学考试也没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:57.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜你 戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.01,0:01:59.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.95,0:02:01.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.45,0:02:04.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢大家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.35,0:02:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.62,0:02:10.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是梦吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.13,0:02:19.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然是梦…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:32.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第57话 一切源自桃源乡之夜 前篇
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:38.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:40.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又要回国啦
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.99,0:02:43.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事用不着这么大声吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.36,0:02:46.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你啊 知道现在是什么时候吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.32,0:02:47.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.99,0:02:48.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,知道归知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:50.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我有很重要的模试呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.26,0:02:53.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,摸是？那什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:56.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,模拟试验 就是考试的意思
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.70,0:02:59.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又是什么“烤事”啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托 只要三天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:04.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还想预习一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.18,0:03:06.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得戈薇姑娘也蛮辛苦的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.11,0:03:09.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直留在这里就轻松多啦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.68,0:03:12.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三天吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.65,0:03:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就那么喜欢那个 叫“烤事”的东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.69,0:03:17.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能会喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:20.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然有点抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想回去故乡个三天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.00,0:03:25.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,故乡？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.70,0:03:27.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要回驱魔师的村子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:31.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想修理飞来骨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.71,0:03:43.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为使用过度了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.65,0:03:44.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么办法
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.85,0:03:45.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有三天喔
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.15,0:03:48.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了 那我也可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.99,0:03:50.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:53.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,三天后我会到枫姥姥的村子
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.66,0:03:55.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走吧 云母
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.23,0:04:02.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.37,0:04:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总算难得能好好休息了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:06.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弥勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.24,0:04:09.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,珊瑚在就不能好好休息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.51,0:04:11.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 不是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.74,0:04:15.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会答应的这么干脆
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.45,0:04:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.32,0:04:19.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.25,0:04:21.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就快点回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.46,0:04:25.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等啦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.11,0:04:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是跑到这里的话…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.55,0:04:52.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.98,0:04:54.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饶了我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.62,0:04:57.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难得收你当弟子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.86,0:05:00.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然逃避修行
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.99,0:05:03.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你讨厌风吹日晒 与饿的前胸贴后背
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.13,0:05:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更不想最后被逼着上战场
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.00,0:05:09.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像蝼蚁一般死去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.33,0:05:12.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说这些话的不是你吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.51,0:05:14.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,饶…饶了我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.87,0:05:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已经对世间没有留恋了…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.58,0:05:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.51,0:05:23.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才让你进入桃源乡 修炼成为仙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.52,0:05:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经不想当仙人了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.82,0:05:28.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么可怕的地方我受够了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:35.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愚蠢的男人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.79,0:06:07.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事 好浓的雾
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.99,0:06:09.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.93,0:06:11.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.13,0:06:17.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总觉得这果实好恶心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.70,0:06:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…人面果
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.80,0:06:20.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人面果？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.21,0:06:22.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.64,0:06:24.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是以人类作为养分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.08,0:06:27.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,结出很像人脸的果实的妖树
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.88,0:06:30.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖树…就是妖怪树吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.95,0:06:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.08,0:06:35.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是会有这么多漂过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.59,0:06:38.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,表示是相当大的树呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:40.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这种时代
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:41.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来场大型战争
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.09,0:06:44.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肥料就多的用不完了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.46,0:06:45.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.60,0:06:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种深山里会有战争吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:49.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:54.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 去调查看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是要回去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.84,0:06:59.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正一定会在意的念不下书
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.74,0:07:01.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且考试是三天后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.18,0:07:05.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没闲功夫休息啦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:06.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等 这些家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.62,0:07:08.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要无视我自己走掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.75,0:07:10.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别拖拖拉拉的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.36,0:07:11.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是赶时间呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.92,0:07:14.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点解决掉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.19,0:07:16.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.38,0:07:31.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.51,0:07:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人面果树就在这上面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:36.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这峭壁的上面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那个吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.52,0:07:43.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:46.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么巨大的人面果树
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.22,0:07:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还是头一次看到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:51.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且这股不祥的妖气…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.23,0:07:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么说
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.46,0:07:55.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该是用了很多人当养分吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.87,0:07:57.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.24,0:07:58.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.57,0:08:00.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.24,0:08:01.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还用说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.74,0:08:03.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一口气砍断那棵妖树
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.51,0:08:04.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么我们也帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.14,0:08:06.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.88,0:08:09.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等到把你们一个个送到峭壁上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.25,0:08:11.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳都下山了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.88,0:08:14.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉一定打算
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在太阳下山前解决掉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.49,0:08:19.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚是朔日
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.26,0:08:21.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,朔日…新月！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:24.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉的妖力会消失
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:25.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成普通人类的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.10,0:08:27.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以犬夜叉才…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.91,0:08:39.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没有长生不老的果实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.28,0:08:46.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老是这种东西连我都吃腻了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.79,0:08:53.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是你…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:56.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,养着这棵妖树吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.93,0:08:59.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:00.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.70,0:09:02.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然没有感受到妖气
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.43,0:09:04.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,却散发出浓厚的死人臭味
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.44,0:09:10.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,呸 找我有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.84,0:09:13.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懒得跟你废话
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.51,0:09:16.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要砍掉这棵怪异的树
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.15,0:09:17.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是你胆敢阻碍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:20.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阻碍你又怎样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.05,0:09:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就连你一起砍
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.69,0:09:31.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对付这肥嘟嘟的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.46,0:09:33.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙起不了作用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.16,0:09:34.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.47,0:09:38.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就用风之伤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.85,0:09:49.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,风之伤竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.68,0:09:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妖怪吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.48,0:09:52.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是愚蠢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.88,0:09:54.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不知道是打哪来的妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.05,0:09:57.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你以为赢得了仙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.89,0:09:59.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙人？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:03.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错 我是桃源乡的仙人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.10,0:10:05.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃果人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.20,0:10:09.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,葫芦变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.00,0:10:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才不是 是你变小了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:18.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙竟然…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:22.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 这不是幻觉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:23.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.88,0:10:25.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这家伙真的是仙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.92,0:10:28.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的事别让我说太多遍
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然是仙人 为什么要这样做
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.12,0:10:34.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 想要进来这里面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:36.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.90,0:10:45.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这只妖怪一定是上好的肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,加油啊 七宝
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.24,0:10:51.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只差一点点了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.24,0:10:53.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 真让人刮目相看
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.55,0:10:55.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想不到你的力气这么大
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.92,0:10:58.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是太大意了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.65,0:11:00.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没想到今天是朔日
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.75,0:11:03.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太阳下山以后
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉就会变成普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.69,0:11:07.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.19,0:11:10.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.56,0:11:13.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.27,0:11:15.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓好了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:22.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.34,0:11:28.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子好像有人住在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.08,0:11:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.28,0:11:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.69,0:11:40.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人类？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.79,0:11:42.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有其他人耶
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.80,0:11:45.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这到底是什么东西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:46.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.36,0:11:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们住在这个地方吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.20,0:11:50.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:53.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂碎片变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.37,0:11:56.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,箱庭也变大了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.21,0:11:59.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 是我们正在缩小
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.99,0:12:17.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.04,0:12:26.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是刚才在走路的小小男人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:28.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,意思是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.74,0:12:31.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是箱庭的内部吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办啦 我们也得住在这里了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:38.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不想个办法出去不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.25,0:12:39.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉会担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.92,0:12:41.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且四魂碎片也…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.92,0:12:43.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说的也是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:44.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.22,0:12:47.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在还搞不清楚状况
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.79,0:12:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总之
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:51.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先听听看这里的人怎么说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.66,0:12:55.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问 大家在这里做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.73,0:12:57.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里并非真实的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.77,0:12:59.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:02.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 有没有在听啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.37,0:13:04.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别打扰我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.88,0:13:06.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们妨碍到修炼了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.74,0:13:07.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,修炼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.88,0:13:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在这做成为仙人的修炼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.08,0:13:14.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,成为仙人的修炼？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要拥有仙人之力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.19,0:13:18.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.69,0:13:19.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还能从桃果人大人那里
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.69,0:13:22.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得到长生不老的人面果
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃果人？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.40,0:13:27.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是把你们 困在这的罪魁祸首吗
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:28.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃果人大人是将我们
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:33.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从饥饿与战乱之中 救出来的大恩人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.84,0:13:35.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么看都只是生锈的刀
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:50.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何那小子一挥 就变成了大刀呢
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.59,0:13:52.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:05.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.30,0:14:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙已经掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:11.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我却没有妖化成妖怪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:14.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来妖力已经减弱成这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.95,0:14:16.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,话说回来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,居然被困在这种鬼地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.12,0:14:20.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,火鼠衣被…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子不能再拖下去
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.62,0:14:25.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只好从内部破坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,散魂铁爪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.40,0:14:31.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.13,0:14:33.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一点点伤痕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.03,0:14:34.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.14,0:14:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.04,0:14:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种东西才不放在眼里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.88,0:14:48.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个死胖子
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等我出去就把你大卸八块
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:53.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,浑蛋！浑蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.89,0:15:01.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爪子…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.66,0:15:04.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 妖力消失了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:17.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.58,0:15:24.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是四魂之玉碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.32,0:15:26.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且还有两块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:27.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这玩意儿只要有一块
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.02,0:15:31.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能让我的身体把刀子弹回去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.19,0:15:35.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要有了这些
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.39,0:15:38.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是金刚不坏之身了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.83,0:15:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 愈来愈多了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:48.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再拖下去会被溶化的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.24,0:15:50.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.08,0:16:02.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做那些事就能成为仙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.92,0:16:03.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不晓得
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.06,0:16:06.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想要拥有仙术
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.12,0:16:08.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确需要肉体的锻炼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.73,0:16:09.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是精神方面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.73,0:16:11.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也必须更加强韧才行
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.06,0:16:13.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请问 那边的诸位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.50,0:16:17.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来你们不是这里的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.07,0:16:19.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是武士吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.70,0:16:23.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你似乎和其他人不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.61,0:16:26.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不 其实没差多少
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.18,0:16:27.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我因为战败
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.68,0:16:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在逃到这个山谷的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.88,0:16:31.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被桃果人抓来这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.95,0:16:35.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想成为仙人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.39,0:16:40.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要我们会一点仙术的话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.19,0:16:43.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马上就会变成人面果的养分
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.23,0:16:46.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我亲眼看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.63,0:16:49.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,桃果人与人面果在对话的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.14,0:16:54.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人面果 还没好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:57.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没结出长生不老的果实吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.64,0:16:58.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还早着呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:02.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再拿更多的仙人之魂来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.38,0:17:03.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我说嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.12,0:17:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙人这东西 哪可能有那么多
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.92,0:17:07.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.85,0:17:11.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只要照我的话做就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:13.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.62,0:17:15.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是 人面果
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.43,0:17:17.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你很罗唆耶
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.19,0:17:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.96,0:17:19.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要把这个拿下来
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.56,0:17:21.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就说不了话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:22.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住 住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,由我代你保管
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.94,0:17:28.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.24,0:17:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把仙人之魂拿给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.01,0:17:32.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是谁！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.71,0:17:35.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么啊 战败的武士吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.25,0:17:45.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去吧！给我好好修行！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:54.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那很可能是四魂碎片
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然很微弱
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:59.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过还是能感受到 四魂碎片的气息
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.74,0:18:02.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是那家伙根本就是坏仙人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.98,0:18:06.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本来 所谓的仙人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.98,0:18:08.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听说如果没有舍弃世俗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.55,0:18:10.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进入独特的境界的话
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:12.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是无法成为仙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.55,0:18:14.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以这里的这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.49,0:18:16.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是无法成为仙人的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.56,0:18:19.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:21.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,竟然是为了成为人面果的肥料
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而被强迫修行
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.53,0:18:27.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些家伙完全 把我说的事情当耳边风
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.33,0:18:30.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也一起去告诉他们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:34.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算了 就算知道这些事也逃不出去
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.77,0:18:35.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:36.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.81,0:18:38.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定有什么方法的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.01,0:18:41.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一定能逃得出去的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.58,0:18:44.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉…你一定要平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.95,0:18:47.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶 可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.79,0:18:49.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.09,0:18:50.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:53.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.29,0:18:55.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变的会感觉到痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.99,0:18:58.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看样子已经变成普通人的身体
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:02.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么样才能离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.07,0:19:06.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,刀鞘在呼唤铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.11,0:19:11.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,铁碎牙一定在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.28,0:19:13.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好 这样也许有用
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.11,0:19:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧 铁碎牙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.62,0:19:27.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多该回去了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.84,0:19:41.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么搞的 这把烂刀
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.38,0:19:47.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错没错 就是这样子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.35,0:19:54.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.86,0:20:01.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.66,0:20:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死胖子 觉悟吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.33,0:20:08.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是刚才那个妖怪小鬼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.87,0:20:10.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:13.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是还你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.80,0:20:15.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.61,0:20:20.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.68,0:20:24.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,臭小子 找死！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.62,0:20:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死胖子 你是从哪里…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:27.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该不会？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.85,0:20:32.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小鬼 该觉悟的是你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.69,0:20:38.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.43,0:21:12.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,四魂之玉碎片的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:15.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,果然够厉害！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.97,0:21:21.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要怎么做才能逃离这里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.74,0:21:25.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这时候犬夜叉一定…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戈薇 没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.48,0:21:29.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到处都找不到出口
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论走到哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.71,0:21:31.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都只有墙壁而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.18,0:21:33.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.49,0:21:39.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有用的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.19,0:21:40.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不就成为仙人之后
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.22,0:21:42.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变成人面果的养分
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:45.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不就这样在这里等死
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.23,0:21:47.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这两种下场
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.50,0:21:48.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么这样
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.20,0:21:50.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:53.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有任何梦想或希望
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.74,0:22:00.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果是梦就醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.85,0:22:05.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种恶梦我不想再做了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:29.28,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,何不把真正重要的事物以外{\fad(500,0)}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:40.78,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全部 都舍弃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.06,0:22:48.30,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现实 往往是如此残酷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.47,0:22:52.03,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但每当 遇到这种时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.24,0:22:56.77,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要紧闭双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.04,0:23:03.51,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,便能看见 你的笑容{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.52,0:23:10.98,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Ah- 但愿从此以往
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.03,0:23:18.56,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到进入 沉眠的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.50,0:23:26.06,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的 那抹笑容
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:34.08,ED,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都绝没有 消逝的瞬间{\fad(0,900)}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.09,0:23:48.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是梦 一定是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.06,0:23:51.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七宝 捏我一下看看…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.26,0:23:53.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好痛…果然不是梦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.13,0:23:56.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,犬夜叉 你现在因为朔日
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.27,0:23:57.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而变成了普通人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.87,0:23:59.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么可能打赢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.80,0:24:01.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个施展怪异仙术的桃果人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.57,0:24:04.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要为了我舍命？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.91,0:24:07.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,笨蛋 不行啊 犬夜叉！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.35,0:24:09.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,次回 犬夜叉
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.65,0:24:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切源自桃源乡之夜 后篇
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.22,0:24:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黎明…快点来临吧
